--- a/readme.md
+++ b/readme.md
@@ -168,3 +168,9 @@ engines or x2t; full editor source correspondence remains unverified.
 ### Save completion across the host boundary
 
 The paired parent library and host use `onlyoffice-browser-host/v2`. `SAVE_ACK` confirms persistence of the returned artifact; `SAVE_COMPLETE` is emitted only after native save state and the host request owner have been released. The public `save()` promise waits for both stages, including failure cleanup. Deploy the parent library and host together; a v1 host is not compatible with this completion contract.
+
+### Preferred UI source and compressed runtime consistency
+
+The preferred CryptPad UI source, separate RequireJS vendor input, original TypeScript wrapper, licenses and build recipes are pinned to the same exact commit as the SDK source. The source bundle excludes upstream fonts. Readable browser adaptations are in `source-overrides`; their changes are applied to original source templates before UI compilation. The UI build also requires the exact preferred SDK archive for its inlined utilities.
+
+The final reviewed font replacements and UI changes precede runtime compression. Every `.br` file must decode to its listed final plain asset, and UI compression uses the same encoder as the source rebuild. File hashes alone cannot verify that relationship. SDK and selected deployed UI asset proof remain narrower than complete editor reproduction, auxiliary WASM/x2t validation, licensing of a hosted integration, or product admission.
