+# Preferred source of the browser UI adaptations
+
+These readable sources retain the upstream AGPL-3.0 context. They are not an official ONLYOFFICE product.
+
+`browser-api.js` is the unminified browser API supplied by the pinned agentbridges-ai/onlyoffice-browser component. The original CryptPad TypeScript wrapper is supplied in cryptpad-ui-source.tar.gz as a reference; this readable JavaScript is the exact current browser adaptation.
+
+`main-application-bootstrap.html` contains the shared readable application hook from the browser component. `scripts/patch-preferred-ui-source.mjs` inserts it into the three original source templates before Grunt builds them, and fixes the original template element lookup in its source file. Expected source hashes guard the patch boundaries. The internal UI build version remains 0.0.0, while the upstream banner retains 9.3.0 build 140, matching the reviewed component.
+
+The preferred CryptPad bundle includes web-apps, onlyoffice-editor, its separate RequireJS vendor input, licenses and build recipes at one exact commit. Upstream fonts are excluded. Reviewed fonts are supplied through the separate license manifest. Runtime compression is regenerated and verified after all final UI and font modifications. SDK, deployed UI assets and compression checks do not certify auxiliary WASM, x2t reproduction, the complete editor or a proprietary hosted service's legal boundary.
